{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13152","headline":"寄刘方平 · 皇甫冉","name":"寄刘方平","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"坐忆山中人，穷栖事南亩。\n烟霞相亲外，墟落今何有。\n潘郎作赋年，陶令辞官後。\n达生遗自适，良愿固无负。\n田取颍水流，树入阳城口。\n岁暮忧思盈，离居不堪久。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}